<title>SOUTH KOREA: TENNIS-ARGENTINE BEAT SOUTH KOREA 4-1 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ARGENTINE BEAT SOUTH KOREA 4-1 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine defeated South Korea 4-1</p>
<p>in their Fed Cup tennis World group two first round tie after</p>
<p>winning two reverse singles and the doubles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results on Sunday (South Korean names first):</p>
<p>Park Sung-hee lost to Florencia Labat 4-6 1-6</p>
<p>Kim Eun-ha lost to Mariana Diaz-Oliva 6-4 3-6 1-6</p>
<p>Park Sung-hee/Kim Eun-ha lost to Mercedes Paz/Laura Montalvo</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3) 4-6 6-7 (2-7)</p>
</text>
